      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "合間に勉強か、熱心だな\r\nテストでも近いのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310020,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そういうことじゃないけど\r\n暇さえあれば、できるだけ勉強するようにしてるの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310030,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "アイドルなんて売れても食べていけないし\r\n旬の短い仕事だから、将来のことも考えないとね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310030"
  },
  {
    "select": "しっかりしてるな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000311"
  },
  {
    "select": "堅実だな",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000312"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "考えすぎるのもよくない",
    "nextLabel": "1802001000313"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310040,
    "label": "1802001000311",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "一応、こどもの頃から仕事してるし\r\n事務所をやめてフリーでやってた時期もあるんだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310050,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "おバカっぽいとか思ってる人もいるみたいだけど\r\nこう見えて色々考えてるのよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310060,
    "label": "1802001000312",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "そりゃ堅実にもなるわよ\r\n売れるために散々挑戦しては失敗してきたんだもの",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310070,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "こうやって保険をかけておくのも\r\n将来のために必要なのよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310080,
    "label": "1802001000313",
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "わかってるわよ\r\nそれに人前では笑ってみせるから心配しないで",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1802001000310090,
    "speaker": "かな",
    "text": "私は実際に売れない状況を経験してるから\r\n色んな可能性を考えずにはいられないのよ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "kana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/180200100031/1802001000310090"
  },
  {
